/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot v4.4.1.stable (49a5bc7b6)\n\n### System information\n\nSteam Deck / Freedesktop SDK 24.08 (Flatpak runtime) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Custom GPU 0932 (radeonsi, vangogh, LLVM 19.1.7, DRM 3.59, 6.11.11-valve19-1-neptune-611-g88b36d49a5e3) - AMD Custom APU 0932 (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhile on Windows everything works as expected when using Microsoft IME, while working on Linux the mozc for fcitx5 Japanese IME won't write any text on the editor or games until the user hits the Enter key to confirm a prediction/conversion.\n\nThe only exception to this is when running a browser version of a game, where the IME works as expected.\n\nI found a report of the same issue back in 3.3.4.stable.Arch_linux (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/53658) where it is said that a solution was implemented back in 2022, but seems like the issue has been introduced again.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAttempt to use the mozc for fcitx5 Japanese IME on the Godot Editor or native game on SteamOS (possibly any Linux distro)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nA project isn't required, it will happen on any Godot Script, textbox, native game, etc.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109946/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109946/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}